    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a rogue-like &amp; bullet-heaven mix; survive by raising hordes of skeletons to fight alongside you against the many foes of ancient Egypt and Greece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the name of Serapis, the ancient Graeco-Egyptian God of life and death, you rebuild a lost religion, raise legendary heroes, find mighty relics, and raise powerful armies of the dead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.poster.avif?t=1749111906\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.webm?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.mp4?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How long will you stay alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different summonable servants &amp; strategies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes</strong> of enemies to run over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ strategy-defining Relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through ancient Egypt &amp; Greece </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch Integration!</strong> <i>Viewers can take over summons with chat commands.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of bones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.poster.avif?t=1749111906\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.webm?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.mp4?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCORD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019d like to stay up to date, be sure to join us on discord for the most recent updates, and options to give feedback! We want to involve <strong>YOU</strong> in the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; FUTURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development. There will be many changes and improvements. Many inspired by play-testers and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oath of the Necromancer</strong> is a rogue-like &amp; bullet-heaven mix; survive by raising hordes of skeletons to fight alongside you against the many foes of ancient Egypt and Greece. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the name of Serapis, the ancient Graeco-Egyptian God of life and death, you rebuild a lost religion, raise legendary heroes, find mighty relics, and raise powerful armies of the dead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.poster.avif?t=1749111906\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.webm?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/9030e4e93dd818950514a895c420035c.mp4?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How long will you stay alive?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different summonable servants &amp; strategies to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes</strong> of enemies to run over</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ strategy-defining Relics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey through ancient Egypt &amp; Greece </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Twitch Integration!</strong> <i>Viewers can take over summons with chat commands.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of bones!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.poster.avif?t=1749111906\" width=616 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.webm?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930030/extras/5aa13cce1300d277f6b87690fab183d6.mp4?t=1749111906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCORD:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019d like to stay up to date, be sure to join us on discord for the most recent updates, and options to give feedback! We want to involve <strong>YOU</strong> in the development!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; FUTURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development. There will be many changes and improvements. Many inspired by play-testers and the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The enemies number in the thousands, let's use those numbers against them. Raise the bones of the fallen, and fight the odds. Take up the Oath, create an army of the undead, strategize on how to build it, and snowball your units into a powerhouse against your foes.",
